      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d6d6ee/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-21T23:36:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Nod_Hero,</p><p>If you are still having issues with this, please PM me your shipping address. There usually arent any problems with Google Wallet, but I'd like to test with your address anyway. If I can reproduce what you are seeing, I can see if there's an error when we contact FedEx to calculate shipping. It's a bit of a complicated setup, but it does work. :)</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
